  "2026-11-14T07:53:15.248Z",codex-toolchain-1114b,"| Failure | Cause (changelog) | Fix |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| changelog:check exits 1 | pm-changelog 2026.11.7 completion-time ordering requires regeneration | regenerate after final tracker write with current exact dependency pins |\n\nThe baseline changelog check fails and regenerated linked check passes. Production and test typechecking, lint, zero-duplication, docstrings, production audit, pack dry-run, changelog check and publish attestation pass. The full isolated npm release attempt reached the explicit 45-minute budget: 261 tests pass, zero assertion failures, six cancellations at cutoff (267 reported). Coverage remains incomplete and is not certified. Full npm and Bun release certification is deferred to the unchanged CI workflow under the task time-budget exception; Bun was not run locally. No seed counts, assertions, source scope or thresholds changed. No production functions changed, so a function-level behavioral revert is inapplicable; the old generated changelog failed the baseline check before regeneration."
